      "originalQuestion": "默认收货地址所在州和客户登记州各组合的订单量对比，列出前 20。",
      "proposedQuestion": "仅统计订单关联客户档案至少有一条默认收货地址（is_default=true）的订单，按默认地址州和该客户档案登记州组合统计不同订单数。同一客户有多个默认地址州时，订单分别计入各州组合；同州重复地址在同组只计一次，未知地址州保留NULL组；无默认地址的客户订单不参与。按订单数降序、地址州及登记州升序（NULL最后）取最多20组。各组不是全订单互斥分区，不得把组内订单数直接相加当全站订单数。",
      "originalGoldSql": "SELECT sa.state AS addr_state, c.customer_state, COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id) AS orders\nFROM shipping_addresses sa\nJOIN customers c ON c.customer_id = sa.customer_id\nJOIN orders o ON o.customer_id = c.customer_id\nWHERE sa.is_default\nGROUP BY 1, 2 ORDER BY orders DESC,1 ASC NULLS LAST,2 ASC NULLS LAST LIMIT 20;",
      "proposedGoldSql": "SELECT sa.state AS addr_state, c.customer_state, COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id) AS orders\nFROM shipping_addresses sa\nJOIN customers c ON c.customer_id = sa.customer_id\nJOIN orders o ON o.customer_id = c.customer_id\nWHERE sa.is_default\nGROUP BY 1, 2 ORDER BY orders DESC,1 ASC NULLS LAST,2 ASC NULLS LAST LIMIT 20;",
      "questionChange": true,
      "goldSqlChange": false,
      "scoringMetadataRequired": true,
      "reasons": [
        "原题未说明无默认与多默认情形。V4明确是默认地址关系分析，保留原INNER覆盖；不能冒充全订单唯一收货归属或实际下单时的地址快照。"
